# Firebase CLIENT configs are safe to commit per Firebase docs — they only
# contain the public project ID / API key (rate-limited & scoped by Firebase
# rules). EAS build needs them at prebuild time. The service-account admin
# key (spidr-secure/*.json) stays OUT of the repo — that one has real power.
*.orig.*
web-build/
.env*
!.env.example
